## v665: Auto Scaling 稳定性配置
## 防止频繁伸缩导致同步任务被SIGTERM中断
## v665更新: 增加Cooldown到900秒，PauseTime到5分钟，Timeout到20分钟，避免大账户同步期间实例被终止

option_settings:
  ## Auto Scaling Group 配置
  aws:autoscaling:asg:
    MinSize: 1
    MaxSize: 3
    Cooldown: 900

  ## 滚动更新配置 - 确保部署时至少有1个实例在线
  aws:autoscaling:updatepolicy:rollingupdate:
    RollingUpdateEnabled: true
    MinInstancesInService: 0
    MaxBatchSize: 1
    PauseTime: PT5M
    RollingUpdateType: Health
    Timeout: PT20M
